  ('matthew', 9, 17, 'jeremiah', 31, 33, 'The new-covenant Torah-internalization — the Torah-substance the new wine carries.'),
  ('matthew', 9, 17, 'ezekiel', 36, 26, 'The new-heart and new-spirit Tanakh-promise — the new-wineskin container the heart-Torah-walking life requires.'),
  ('matthew', 9, 17, 'matthew', 5, 17, 'The load-bearing anti-antinomian declaration of the Sermon — locks the Torah-affirmation that Matt 9:17 cannot be reread to undo.'),
