  ('matthew', 10, 5, 'romans', 15, 8, '*Now I say that Yahusha (Jesus) Christ was a minister of the circumcision for the truth of Elohim (God), to confirm the promises made unto the fathers* — Paul''s framework-statement of the King''s mission-scope.'),
